he 1991\u20132020 normal is 12.0 inches a year. The wettest year was 1978 (27.67 in); the driest, 2002 (2.63 in). Long Beach almost never sees snow (the 1991\u20132020 average is 0.0 inches a winter), so there's no snowfall chart.","show_snow":false,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 10 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}